## Extracting column variables
#### At this step (CHUNK 2.3) the following fields were "widened" ("un-nested"/"extracted") and now appear as column variables:
Time source (createTime) (note:not yet transformed)
Ad flag (is_ad_platform)
Post text description (desc_raw) (note:not yet cleaned)
IDs/handles (item_id, author_id, author_handle)
Engagement (engage_*)
Hashtags (hashtags)
Duration (duration_s)
Text language (text_lang)
Importantly, no transformations were made for these variables. There are simply, essentially, "copy-and-paste" from the scraped metadata.


