## URL permalinks 
#### The metadata does not include a URL permalink to each video. This link must be created using the following "formula":
"https://www.tiktok.com/@", author_handle, "/video/", item_id. 
It is helpful to have each video URL for later cross references to the full, multi-media artifact. Note: "Textual Representation Error" is the discrepancy between the original online artifact (in this case, TikTok video) and the subsequent representations, such as transcription, or cells of data (Bodell et. al, 2022). Cross-references to the original artifact help "tune" and reduce Textual Representation Error.

```{r echo=FALSE, message=FALSE, warning=FALSE}
